    {
      "type": "note",
      "text": "Filters and the map narrow the same list; a city dot sets the City filter, and its size grows with the number of clubs. The list is every cab club that is not archived, read from cab's public club API (city, meeting time, contacts, format, language, audience, as each club head set them in cab) and cached here. Map positions come from uadebate's own table of Ukrainian city coordinates; nothing is stored per club. Members-only clubs appear too, with their public profile."
